{"name":"HTTP Catcher","dev":"MESS LAB LTD","keys":["ios:1445874902"],"ios":{"id":"1445874902","url":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/http-catcher/id1445874902?uo=4","rating":3.07299,"ratings":137,"price":"Free","genre":"Developer Tools","screens":["https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource124/v4/57/22/73/572273a7-fa63-9758-940e-ddfb3f8e3c7b/810e65b4-1f77-4fa7-a38b-7f78410a02f7_iPhone_8_Plus-01Home.png/392x696bb.png","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource124/v4/09/5f/ff/095fffc1-fe2e-ff85-1f53-0c12dfd2c104/e92ff29d-fe85-43ff-9432-b2132923f2dd_iPhone_8_Plus-02Headers.png/392x696bb.png","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource124/v4/4c/f0/60/4cf060d3-ec2b-2237-642f-c984dc5c8a4a/566814c9-16b4-4bf5-b4ce-0aef5de8902a_iPhone_8_Plus-03RawHeaders.png/392x696bb.png","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource124/v4/fa/89/8d/fa898db8-478f-a1f6-2443-35b78c6e3a6a/e3e5484a-cbf6-4e93-b907-c4335fd03bef_iPhone_8_Plus-04Cookies.png/392x696bb.png","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource124/v4/db/f1/b2/dbf1b2c7-3a83-4daf-5d5d-4ec2b471dadf/01de3b79-a0ec-427c-9afb-e5d7dea76726_iPhone_8_Plus-05Params.png/392x696bb.png","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource114/v4/5f/7d/5f/5f7d5fb9-7c50-7896-332f-5e94a911e584/3715e18d-9bbe-446c-9e50-903273847def_iPhone_8_Plus-06Response.png/392x696bb.png","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource114/v4/2a/00/3f/2a003f19-1412-e89c-c2eb-f1e56cafe65c/6c5b4581-425e-497f-8695-242f1dbecceb_iPhone_8_Plus-07Timings.png/392x696bb.png"],"desc":"HTTP Catcher is a web debugging proxy. It can be used to intercept, inspect, modify and replay web traffic.\n\nYou don't need to connect to a computer, HTTP Catcher records HTTP traffic under Wi-Fi and cellular networks in the background. HTTP Catcher makes it easy to test your apps and websites, and you can view requests and responses directly.\n\nHOW IT WORKS\nHTTP Catcher creates a local VPN on your device. When you start to capture web traffic, HTTP Catcher will launch a local http proxy in VPN process. All of your web traffic will be forwarded to the local http proxy via VPN.\n\nFEATURES\n* Decrypt HTTPS traffic\n* View WebSocket\n* Block URL\n* Replay request\n* Modify requests and responses on the fly\n* Domain name filter\n* HTML, JavaScript, CSS reformat and re-indent\n* HEX viewer\n* DNS mapping","released":"2018-12-13","updated":"2021-06-03","icon":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple115/v4/af/ba/c7/afbac795-6256-bf28-4561-0ee18a27bc31/AppIcon-0-0-1x_U007emarketing-0-0-0-7-0-0-sRGB-0-0-0-GLES2_U002c0-512MB-85-220-0-0.png/512x512bb.jpg","age":"4+"},"android":null,"icon":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple115/v4/af/ba/c7/afbac795-6256-bf28-4561-0ee18a27bc31/AppIcon-0-0-1x_U007emarketing-0-0-0-7-0-0-sRGB-0-0-0-GLES2_U002c0-512MB-85-220-0-0.png/512x512bb.jpg","cat":"Developer Tools","rating":3.07,"ratings":137,"mentions":1,"users":1,"threads":1,"hn_points":2,"hn_comments":0,"submissions":1,"self_n":1,"hn_score":1.58,"first":1570862582,"last":1570862582,"show_hn":{"time":1570862582,"points":2,"id":21231097,"title":"Show HN: HTTP Catcher – Web Debugging Proxy for iOS"},"n_lab":0,"pos_pct":null,"neg_pct":null,"mood":null,"quotes":[{"id":21231097,"k":"ios:1445874902","type":"story","by":"gzhi1992","time":1570862582,"text":"","title":"Show HN: HTTP Catcher – Web Debugging Proxy for iOS","story_id":21231097,"story_title":"Show HN: HTTP Catcher – Web Debugging Proxy for iOS","story_score":2,"comments":0,"w":1.585,"u":-1,"s":"pos","self":true}],"slug":"http-catcher"}